## Release Overview

MedSync maintains a continuous delivery model with multiple release types supporting rapid iteration while ensuring platform stability. Average deployment frequency is 15 releases per day.

---

## Release Types

### Release Categories

| Type | Frequency | Approval | Deployment Window |
|------|-----------|----------|-------------------|
| Hotfix | As needed | 1 engineer | Immediate |
| Patch | Daily | 2 engineers | Anytime |
| Minor | Weekly | Team lead | Business hours |
| Major | Monthly | VP Engineering | Scheduled maintenance |
| Emergency | As needed | Director + | Immediate |

### Release Scope

| Type | Scope | Examples |
|------|-------|----------|
| Hotfix | Single bug fix | Security patch, critical bug |
| Patch | Bug fixes, minor improvements | Performance fix, UI tweak |
| Minor | New features, enhancements | New report, integration update |
| Major | Significant changes | New module, architecture change |
| Emergency | Critical fixes | Security incident, outage |

