## Release Process

### Standard Release Flow

| Phase | Activities | Duration | Owner |
|-------|------------|----------|-------|
| Development | Code, test, review | Variable | Engineer |
| Code Review | PR review, approval | 1-4 hours | Team |
| CI/CD | Automated build, test | 15 min | Automated |
| Staging | Staging deployment, QA | 1-24 hours | QA |
| Production | Production deployment | 5-15 min | On-call |
| Monitoring | Post-deploy monitoring | 30 min | On-call |

### Release Checklist

| Item | Required For | Owner |
|------|--------------|-------|
| Code review approved | All | Engineer |
| Tests passing | All | CI/CD |
| Documentation updated | Minor+ | Engineer |
| Change request logged | Minor+ | Engineer |
| Rollback plan documented | Major | Team Lead |
| Customer communication | Major | Product |
| Stakeholder notification | Major | PM |

