## Deployment Pipeline

### CI/CD Pipeline

| Stage | Tools | Duration |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Build | GitHub Actions | 2 min |
| Unit Tests | Jest, pytest | 5 min |
| Integration Tests | Cypress | 8 min |
| Security Scan | Snyk, SonarQube | 3 min |
| Container Build | Docker | 2 min |
| Push to Registry | ECR | 1 min |
| Deploy to Staging | ArgoCD | 3 min |
| Smoke Tests | Automated | 2 min |

### Environment Progression

| Environment | Purpose | Deploy Trigger |
|-------------|---------|----------------|
| Development | Developer testing | On commit |
| Integration | Integration testing | On merge to develop |
| Staging | QA, UAT | On merge to main |
| Production | Live | Manual approval |

### Deployment Strategy

| Strategy | Use Case | Configuration |
|----------|----------|---------------|
| Rolling | Default | 25% at a time |
| Blue-Green | Major releases | Full switch |
| Canary | High-risk changes | 5% → 25% → 100% |
| Feature Flags | Gradual rollout | LaunchDarkly |

