## Rollback Procedures

### Rollback Triggers

| Trigger | Action |
|---------|--------|
| Error rate > 0.5% | Auto-rollback |
| Latency > 2x baseline | Manual review |
| Health check failure | Auto-rollback |
| Customer reports | Manual decision |

### Rollback Process

| Step | Action | Time | Owner |
|------|--------|------|-------|
| 1 | Detect issue | — | Monitoring |
| 2 | Assess impact | 5 min | On-call |
| 3 | Decision to rollback | 5 min | Tech lead |
| 4 | Execute rollback | 5 min | On-call |
| 5 | Verify stability | 15 min | On-call |
| 6 | Incident report | 1 hour | Engineer |

### Rollback Statistics

| Metric | Q4 2024 |
|--------|---------|
| Total Rollbacks | 11 |
| Avg Rollback Time | 12 min |
| Auto-triggered | 6 |
| Manual | 5 |

